// The B06 boss arena (WP-074): a flat copy of the Drowned Cathedral's nave and the Drowned
// Choir. docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B06 The Drowned Choir". The layout matches the
// level (game/data/levels/mirrormere), shifted so the nave runs x in [-18, 18], z in [0, 34]:
//   - The player spawns at (0, 0, 46) facing -Z, outside the fog gate.
//   - The fog gate is the plane z = 36, 8 m wide, opening into the nave (-Z). The front door is
//     x in [-4, 4]; walls close the west, east, apse, and the rest of the front.
//   - The Choir waits at the apse end: the Cantor at (0, 0, 8), the Bellbearer 4.5 m to -X and
//     3 m nearer the door, the Lamenter 4.5 m to +X, all facing the door (+Z).
//   - Two rows of four pillars stand at x = +-10 (z = 7, 14, 21, 28). The side aisles beyond
//     them (|x| in [11, 18]) are waist-deep water (0.9 m; it slows the player), where Storm
//     deals 1.5x (a `water` zone, which the Storm Spear reads).
(
  spawn: (0.0, 0.0, 46.0),
  spawn_yaw: 3.1415927,
  kill_y: -12.0,
  heightfield: None,
  boxes: [
    (name: "floor", center: (0.0, -0.5, 22.0), half_extents: (19.0, 0.5, 26.0)),
    (name: "wall_west", center: (-19.0, 5.0, 17.0), half_extents: (1.0, 5.0, 18.0)),
    (name: "wall_east", center: (19.0, 5.0, 17.0), half_extents: (1.0, 5.0, 18.0)),
    (name: "wall_apse", center: (0.0, 5.0, -1.0), half_extents: (20.0, 5.0, 1.0)),
    (name: "wall_front_west", center: (-11.5, 5.0, 35.0), half_extents: (7.5, 5.0, 1.0)),
    (name: "wall_front_east", center: (11.5, 5.0, 35.0), half_extents: (7.5, 5.0, 1.0)),
    (name: "pillar_w0", center: (-10.0, 3.5, 7.0), half_extents: (0.75, 3.5, 0.75)),
    (name: "pillar_e0", center: (10.0, 3.5, 7.0), half_extents: (0.75, 3.5, 0.75)),
